@startuml sequence_ci_run
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title CI Run

participant CI
participant Backend as B
participant SPA
participant Playwright as PW
participant Browser

CI -> B: dotnet run --environment e2e
CI -> SPA: pnpm start --port 4200
CI -> PW: pnpm playwright test
PW -> Browser: launch headless
loop for each viewport
    PW -> Browser: open dashboard
    PW -> B: POST /test/seed/reset + /apply
    PW -> Browser: run spec assertions
end
PW --> CI: report (HTML + traces on failure)

@enduml
